      <span class="clearwater-eyebrow">How pricing works</span>
      <h2>Flat rate, every time.</h2>
      <p>Every service on this page has a published price — a dispatcher or tech confirms it on the phone before we roll. On the rare job where the condition we find is substantially different from what was described, we pause, call you, and agree on a new number before continuing. No invoice ever arrives with a number that wasn't agreed to.</p>
      <p>What's included in every flat rate:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Materials for the job as scoped</li>
        <li>Permit fees where required</li>
        <li>Haul-away of anything we removed</li>
        <li>Clean-up: the jobsite is swept and wiped before we leave</li>
        <li>One-year warranty on labor and any install</li>
      </ul>
      <p>What's extra:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>After-hours emergency: 1.5× the published rate, max</li>
        <li>Drywall repair beyond access holes (we refer you to a drywaller we trust)</li>
        <li>Upgraded fixtures beyond the standard lines we carry</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

